Operation: trip.set_name: Name the trip.

Records:
- r1: Trip 1 · collecting · traveler: Bianchi
- r2: Trip 2 · collecting · traveler: Haddad
- by_name: a record the user names that is not listed
- ambiguous: more than one listed record fits

The card on screen is about r1.

Last assistant message: «Trip 1 for Bianchi is open. What should it say?»

Message:
S1: [1]I [2]want [3]to [4]set [5]name

Request: words 4 to 5, «set name»

